@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam sequenceArrowColor #6143B7
skinparam participantBackgroundColor #F1EEF8
skinparam participantBorderColor #6143B7
participant "docusign sandbox" as D
participant "PUG receiver" as P
participant "Durable inbox / worker" as W
participant "Oracle simulator" as O
D -> P: Completed event
P -> P: Verify signature on raw bytes
P -> W: Commit receipt and pending work
P --> D: 2xx after commit
W -> D: Read authoritative status + evidence
D --> W: Completed + document references
W -> W: Validate mapping / buyer-approved plan
W -> O: Command with stable ID + expected version
O -> O: Apply once; store command receipt
O --x W: Response lost
W -> W: Mark UNKNOWN; do not blindly resend
W -> O: Lookup receipt by command ID
O --> W: Applied; PO version 4
W -> O: Read PO and reference
O --> W: Expected values
W -> W: Mark VERIFIED with evidence
D -> P: Redelivery of same event
P --> D: 2xx; no second business effect
@enduml
